WEBVTT

00:04:30.839 --> 00:04:33.257
And at this point, by this summer,

00:04:33.281 --> 00:04:36.413
everybody -- scientists,
sports scientists,

00:04:37.016 --> 00:04:40.070
endurance experts, neurologists,

00:04:41.319 --> 00:04:43.713
my own team, Bonnie --

00:04:45.755 --> 00:04:47.007
said it's impossible.

00:04:47.582 --> 00:04:50.130
It just simply can't be done,
and Bonnie said to me,

00:04:50.154 --> 00:04:52.140
"But if you're going to take the journey,

00:04:52.164 --> 00:04:54.355
I'm going to see you
through to the end of it,

00:04:54.379 --> 00:04:55.542
so I'll be there."

00:04:55.566 --> 00:04:57.007
And now we're there.